  "_botSpawns": "Every bot starts on the ground. Structures are somewhere bots MOVE to, never somewhere they begin: a squad that opens the round already on a roof reads as spawning in the sky and gives the player nothing to walk into. Positions were found by tools/ground-spawns and are re-checked by tools/map-validate.",
  "_flow": "Three street-level pieces were added here to cut a 60.4m diagonal against a 52m band, and then removed: they took the map from 29 sim engagements to ZERO. A 16 percent band overshoot is a tuning note; a map that produces no fights is a broken map. Urban keeps its long diagonal on purpose. Measured with tools/probe-map."
}
